DESCRIPTION:Summer Splash is a family-friendly running event taking place at ROSHN Front in Riyadh\, featuring 2 km and 5 km run and walk categories. Organized by Race Arabia\, the event combines fitness and entertainment with splash zones\, water activities\, and a lively community atmosphere\, offering participants of all ages a unique summer running experience. Register Now
